{
  "id": "27814_susumeru",
  "headword": "{薦|すす}める",
  "reading": "すすめる",
  "romaji": "susumeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to recommend; to endorse; to put forward",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to recommend; to endorse; to put forward",
      "explanation": "To suggest a particular person, book, product, or option to someone as being good or suitable. Written 薦める when vouching for a specific thing or candidate."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27814_susumeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "この{本|ほん}を{薦|すす}めます。",
      "english": "I recommend this book.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27814_susumeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{友人|ゆうじん}に{薦|すす}められて{映画|えいが}を{見|み}た。",
      "english": "I watched the movie because a friend recommended it.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27814_susumeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{店長|てんちょう}は{自信|じしん}を{持|も}って、この{店|みせ}の{看板|かんばん}メニューを{薦|すす}めてくれた。",
      "english": "The manager confidently recommended the restaurant's signature dish.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Written with 薦 when recommending a specific item, work, or candidate as worthy of being chosen. The recommender vouches for the thing's quality.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {本|ほん}を{薦|すす}める: to recommend a book\n- {候補|こうほ}に{薦|すす}める: to put forward as a candidate\n- {自信|じしん}を{持|も}って{薦|すす}める: to recommend with confidence\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {勧|すす}める: to urge; to encourage — recommends doing an action, e.g. {入会|にゅうかい}を{勧|すす}める; the two spellings overlap and are often used interchangeably\n- {進|すす}める: to advance; to move forward — an unrelated verb with the same reading",
